          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJowashi, inkosi yakwa-Israyeli, wathumela ku-Amaziya inkosi yakwaJuda, wathi: “Ikhakhasi laseLebanoni lathumela emsedarini oseLebanoni, lathi: “Nika indodakazi yakho ibe ngumkami, futhi lapho-ke isihlahla sokhula saseLebanoni sathumela kumsedari oseLebanoni. Yadlula isilo sasendle eLebanoni, sanyathela ukhula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.18"
            ]
          }
        }
