          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lithi: Khangela, ubatshayile abakwaEdoma; futhi inhliziyo yakho ikuphakamisele enkazimulweni; hlala ekhaya manje; Ugxambukelani ebubini bakho, ukuze uwe, wena noJuda kanye nawe?",
          "type": "text",
