          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathatha lonke igolide, nesiliva, nazo zonke izitsha ezatholakala endlini kaNkulunkulu ku-Obede Edomi, nengcebo yendlu yenkosi, nabathunjwa, wabuyela eSamariya.",
          "type": "text",
